Multichar_Symbols
    V+ CV^R+ Con Vow

! fixed-lengt initial reduplication: CV, V->V, like like Tagalog in excercise  (pdf 496)

LEXICON ROOT
IniVDup ; ! V => V

LEXICON IniVDup
CV^R+:ConVow CloseIniVDup  ;
             CloseIniVDup  ;

LEXICON CloseIniVDup
patu VTag ;   ! "to strike, hit, beat, assault, kill" -> papatu "beat one another, clash, fight one another."
taki VTag ;   ! "to lead, challenge" -> tataki "to lead/guide in succession"

LEXICON VTag
+V:0   #;

